          "html": "Agrith-Na-Na uses <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Melee\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">melee</a> when in range and uses <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Fire_Blast\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Fire Blast</a> when not in melee range.",
          "text": "Agrith-Na-Na uses melee when in range and uses Fire Blast when not in melee range.",
